{
  "dom_id": "step-41775",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Utilizing the Oddness Property of the Sine Function",
  "problem": "If $\\sin{x} = -\\dfrac{4}{7},$ then what is the value of $\\sin(-x + 16 \\pi)?$",
  "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the graph of $y = \\sin{x}.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14255188/assets/08d442eff9febe44bd39e6c15c998d76d56d17bbb7a676d2d511771479bb2f29.png)\n\nFrom the graph, we note the following:\n\n- The period of $\\sin{x}$ is $2\\pi.$\n\n- Our graph has rotational symmetry of order $2$ about the origin. This means that $\\sin{x}$ is an *odd* function, and we have\n\n$$\n\\sin(-x) = -\\sin{x}.\n$$\n\nLet's now evaluate our expression:\n\n- Firstly, using the periodicity of $\\sin{x},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-x+16\\pi ) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-x+2\\pi \\cdot 8) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Secondly, using the oddness of $\\sin{x},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-x) & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\  & =-(-\\frac{4}{7}) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\sin(-x + 16\\pi) = \\dfrac{4}{7}.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-41775\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"41775\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"11001\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-41775\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-10\">Utilizing the Oddness Property of the Sine Function</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"41775\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n              